---
title: SHACL Ontology Design Cycle
---
flowchart TD
    classDef foundation fill:#1F4E79,color:#fff,stroke:#1F4E79,font-weight:bold
    classDef cycle fill:#2E75B6,color:#fff,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef post fill:#404040,color:#fff,stroke:#404040
    classDef decision fill:#BDD7EE,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef iterate stroke:#E05A00,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 3,fill:#FFF4EC,color:#1A1A1A

    F0["⬛ Phase 0\nGovernance & Scope\nFoundation"]:::foundation
    F1["⬛ Phase 1\nNamespace Strategy"]:::foundation

    P2["🔵 Phase 2\nUse Case Development &\nExemplar Sketching"]:::cycle
    P3["🔵 Phase 3\nTaxonomy & Reification\nIdentification"]:::cycle
    P4["🔵 Phase 4\nFirst-Pass Schema\nGeneration"]:::cycle
    P5["🔵 Phase 5\nAbstract Shape &\nUpper Ontology"]:::cycle
    P6["🔵 Phase 6\nValidation, Testing &\nRegression"]:::cycle
    P7["🔵 Phase 7\nStakeholder Review &\nGoverned Revision"]:::cycle

    P8["⬛ Phase 8\nTransformer &\nIntegration Dev"]:::post
    P9["⬛ Phase 9\nOngoing Governance &\nSchema Evolution"]:::post

    D1{Exit criteria\nmet?}:::decision
    D2{Nature of\nrevision?}:::decision

    F0 --> F1 --> P2

    P2 <-->|"Bidirectional\niteration"| P3
    P3 --> P4
    P4 --> P5
    P5 --> P6
    P6 --> P7
    P7 --> D1

    D1 -->|Yes| P8
    D1 -->|No| D2

    D2 -->|"Exemplar\nproblems"| P2
    D2 -->|"Schema\nstructure only"| P4
    D2 -->|"Validation\nfailures"| P5

    P8 --> P9

    style F0 rx:8,ry:8
    style F1 rx:8,ry:8
    style P8 rx:8,ry:8
    style P9 rx:8,ry:8
